## 2. Requirements & EARS Acceptance Criteria

> Use **EARS (Easy Approach to Requirements Syntax)** so every criterion is numbered (`Req 1.1`, `Req 1.2`) and directly traceable in `design.md`, `tasks.md`, and `uat.md`:
> - `WHEN <trigger>, THE <System/Module> SHALL <expected response>.`
> - `IF <unwanted condition>, THEN THE <System/Module> SHALL <error handling response>.`
> - `WHILE <state>, THE <System/Module> SHALL <behavior>.`
> - `WHERE <optional feature/input is present>, THE <System/Module> SHALL <behavior>.`

